---
title: "setLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_caller: receive(id, addr)
    q_validate_caller --> q_validate_addr: caller is authorized
    q_validate_caller --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert unauthorized
    q_validate_addr --> q_store: addr != address(0)
    q_validate_addr --> q_revert_zero: addr == address(0)
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert zero address
    q_store --> q_emit: registry[id] = addr
    q_emit --> [*]: emit AddressSet(id, addr)

    note right of q_validate_caller
        INV-001: only authorized roles can update registry entries
    end note

    note right of q_store
        INV-002: registry[id] is updated atomically
        INV-003: addr != address(0) after store
    end note
